{"4760700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chronicles Of The Sinner", "steam_appid": 4760700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronicles of The Sinner</strong> is a first-person psychological survival horror that plunges you into a suffocating atmosphere of dread and isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/8a14c1c1211472ffc70ce8ea52ee9908.webp?t=1780065240\" width=578 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone investigator dispatched to uncover the source of unsettling, inexplicable sounds echoing from a long-abandoned orphanage. What was supposed to be a routine check quickly devolves into a desperate, waking nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/7f9aab3fdbabf065fb8e1982b73dc41b.poster.avif?t=1780065240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/7f9aab3fdbabf065fb8e1982b73dc41b.webm?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/7f9aab3fdbabf065fb8e1982b73dc41b.mp4?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/e8f2141c529b7b655733b880f87d38db.webp?t=1780065240\" width=578 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a realistic survival horror experience where your greatest enemy might be your own brain. Scavenge for scarce resources, manage your tools, and fight to keep your sanity intact. As the shadows lengthen, horrific events will warp your perception of reality - making you question every sound, every shadow, and every step.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Terror:</strong> You are not alone. The entities lurking in the dark react dynamically to your movement, the noise you make, and how you behave. Adapt or perish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes:</strong> No hand-holding. Every choice you make carries weight, and every single mistake could be your last.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/69590c6058191882fd32388463a42d20.poster.avif?t=1780065240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/69590c6058191882fd32388463a42d20.webm?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/69590c6058191882fd32388463a42d20.mp4?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/d0412cb27b4a63a37b1a556c948fba43.webp?t=1780065240\" width=578 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through interconnected, semi-open environments where exploration is key to survival. Search for hidden pathways, solve puzzles, experiment with your surroundings, and piece together the gruesome history rotting within the orphanage walls… and deep beneath them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>What truly happened here? Why was it abandoned?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/c1cc5fad66df04e2f31a876f899f554d.poster.avif?t=1780065240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/c1cc5fad66df04e2f31a876f899f554d.webm?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/c1cc5fad66df04e2f31a876f899f554d.mp4?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dare to find the answers before the orphange devours you entirely...</strong>  <br> <br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronicles of The Sinner</strong> is a first-person psychological survival horror that plunges you into a suffocating atmosphere of dread and isolation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/8a14c1c1211472ffc70ce8ea52ee9908.webp?t=1780065240\" width=578 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone investigator dispatched to uncover the source of unsettling, inexplicable sounds echoing from a long-abandoned orphanage. What was supposed to be a routine check quickly devolves into a desperate, waking nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/7f9aab3fdbabf065fb8e1982b73dc41b.poster.avif?t=1780065240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/7f9aab3fdbabf065fb8e1982b73dc41b.webm?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared