/d0412cb27b4a63a37b1a556c948fba43.webp?t=1780065240\" width=578 height=49 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through interconnected, semi-open environments where exploration is key to survival. Search for hidden pathways, solve puzzles, experiment with your surroundings, and piece together the gruesome history rotting within the orphanage walls… and deep beneath them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>What truly happened here? Why was it abandoned?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/c1cc5fad66df04e2f31a876f899f554d.poster.avif?t=1780065240\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/c1cc5fad66df04e2f31a876f899f554d.webm?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/extras/c1cc5fad66df04e2f31a876f899f554d.mp4?t=1780065240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dare to find the answers before the orphange devours you entirely...</strong>  <br> <br> </p>", "short_description": "Chronicles of The Sinner is a first-person survival horror set inside an abandoned orphanage. As a lone investigator, you are sent to uncover what happened within its walls. Explore, gather resources, solve puzzles, and try to survive… if you don’t lose yourself first.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/e37fdd817a23a04ab0fe2bfede4235cb9a9c5425/header.jpg?t=1780065240", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4760700/f57c6b331390b93dfa1c680